---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Connor Myers / Metater about games, Unity development, networking systems, or MetaVoiceChat.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell contact-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero__eyebrow"><span class="kicker">Contact</span><span>Connor Myers</span></div>
        <h1>Start with the work.</h1>
        <p class="lead">For collaboration, technical questions, or support, use the channel closest to what you are building.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a class="contact-link" href="https://github.com/Metater"><strong>GitHub</strong><span>Code & public projects ↗</span></a>
        <a class="contact-link" href="https://discord.gg/k4ZtGAA2Nt"><strong>Discord</strong><span>MetaVoiceChat support ↗</span></a>
        <a class="contact-link" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4285690/"><strong>Steam</strong><span>Released games ↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="shell contact-grid">
      <div><span class="section-number">01 / Best route</span><h2>Clear context gets a better answer.</h2></div>
      <div><p>For MetaVoiceChat support, post in the support channel and include your Unity version, networking provider, package version, and relevant logs. For development conversations, link the project or describe the constraint you are trying to solve.</p><p class="callout">A public business email and downloadable résumé can be added here when approved.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

